3 Type Mapping
**************

The following type conversions are performed automatically:

Python                        Perl
------------------------------------------------------------
‘str’                         String scalar
‘int’                         Integer scalar (IV)
‘float’                       Float scalar (NV)
‘bool’                        ‘$true’ / ‘$false’
‘None’                        ‘undef’
‘list’                        Array reference
‘dict’                        Hash reference


