5 Prerequisites
***************

   • Python >= 3.12
   • Perl development headers (‘libperl-dev’ on Debian/Ubuntu)
   • ‘libcrypt-dev’ (on Debian/Ubuntu)
   • Rust toolchain (for building from source)


